From: eri reskin <noreply@eri.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] eri-08: status bar mic / diffusion-fire indicator

Adds a leftmost status bar entry showing eri's microphone state with a
CSS-only animated waveform when listening, and a pulsing blue dot when
the diffusion runtime is firing. Clicking the entry triggers the
`eri.toggleMic` command.

Implements RESKIN_PUNCH_LIST.md §2.4 + §8.

